  "text": "<h2 id=\"Personal_life\">Personal life</h2>\n<h2 id=\"Career_for_Ukraine\">Career for Ukraine</h2>\n<h2 id=\"Partnership_with_Szolkowy_for_Germany\">Partnership with Szolkowy for Germany</h2>\n<h3 id=\"Formation\">Formation</h3>\n<h3 id=\"Training\">Training</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2003–2004_and_2004–2005_seasons\"><span id=\"2003.E2.80.932004_and_2004.E2.80.932005_seasons\"></span>2003–2004 and 2004–2005 seasons</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2005–2006_season\"><span id=\"2005.E2.80.932006_season\"></span>2005–2006 season</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2006–2007_season\"><span id=\"2006.E2.80.932007_season\"></span>2006–2007 season</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2007–2008_season\"><span id=\"2007.E2.80.932008_season\"></span>2007–2008 season</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2008–2009_season\"><span id=\"2008.E2.80.932009_season\"></span>2008–2009 season</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2009–2010_season\"><span id=\"2009.E2.80.932010_season\"></span>2009–2010 season</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2010–2011_season\"><span id=\"2010.E2.80.932011_season\"></span>2010–2011 season</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2011–2012_season\"><span id=\"2011.E2.80.932012_season\"></span>2011–2012 season</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2012–2013_season\"><span id=\"2012.E2.80.932013_season\"></span>2012–2013 season</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2013–2014_season\"><span id=\"2013.E2.80.932014_season\"></span>2013–2014 season</h3>\n<h2 id=\"Partnership_with_Massot_for_Germany\">Partnership with Massot for Germany</h2>\n<h3 id=\"Formation_2\">Formation</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2015–2016_season\"><span id=\"2015.E2.80.932016_season\"></span>2015–2016 season</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2016–2017_season\"><span id=\"2016.E2.80.932017_season\"></span>2016–2017 season</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2017–2018_season\"><span id=\"2017.E2.80.932018_season\"></span>2017–2018 season</h3>\n<h2 id=\"Plans_to_resume_her_competitive_career_in_the_United_States\">Plans to resume her competitive career in the United States</h2>\n<h2 id=\"Show_career\">Show career</h2>\n<h2 id=\"Holiday_on_Ice\">Holiday on Ice</h2>\n<h2 id=\"Coaching\">Coaching</h2>\n<h2 id=\"Choreography\">Choreography</h2>\n<h2 id=\"Books_and_documentaries\">Books and documentaries</h2>\n<h2 id=\"Programs\">Programs</h2>\n<h3 id=\"With_Massot\">With Massot</h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align: center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Season\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Short_program_(figure_skating)\" title=\"Short program (figure skating)\">Short program</a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Free_skating\" title=\"Free skating\">Free skating</a>\n</th>\n<th>Exhibition\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>2017–2018 <br/><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-ISU-1718a_131-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ISU-1718a-131\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>131<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-GS171125_132-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-GS171125-132\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>132<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-IN171125_108-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-IN171125-108\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>108<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-ISU-1718b_133-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ISU-1718b-133\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>133<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</th>\n<td>\n<ul><li>That Man <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/Caroline_van_der_Leeuw\" title=\"Caroline van der Leeuw\">Caro Emerald</a> </span></li></ul>\n<hr/>\n<ul><li>Ameksa - Fuego <br/> <span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by Taalbi Brothers <br/> edited by <a href=\"/wiki/Maxime_Rodriguez\" title=\"Maxime Rodriguez\">Maxime Rodriguez</a> <br/> choreo. by <a href=\"/wiki/John_Kerr_(figure_skater)\" title=\"John Kerr (figure skater)\">John Kerr</a> </span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>La terre vue du ciel <br/> <span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/Armand_Amar\" title=\"Armand Amar\">Armand Amar</a> <br/> edited by Maxime Rodriguez <br/> choreo. by <a href=\"/wiki/Christopher_Dean\" title=\"Christopher Dean\">Christopher Dean</a>,